---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Privacy Policy"
	description="What data this site collects, how it is used, and your rights under GDPR."
>
	<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

	<p><em>Last updated: August 2026</em></p>

	<p>
		This page explains what happens to data when you visit this site. It is
		written to comply with the EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR).
	</p>

	<h2>Who is responsible</h2>

	<p>
		This site is operated by an individual based in Romania. For any privacy
		question, contact
		<a href="mailto:hello@example.com">hello@example.com</a>.
	</p>

	<h2>What this site collects directly</h2>

	<p>
		This site does not require an account, does not run a newsletter, and does
		not ask you to submit personal information. It does not set its own
		tracking cookies.
	</p>

	<p>
		The hosting provider (Cloudflare Pages) processes standard technical
		request data such as IP address and browser type, for security and to serve
		the site. This is necessary for the site to function.
	</p>

	<h2>Third parties</h2>

	<p>
		<strong>Amazon.</strong> This site contains affiliate links to Amazon. When
		you click one, Amazon may set cookies and collect data according to its own
		privacy policy, over which this site has no control. Purchases are recorded
		by Amazon so that a commission can be attributed. This site never receives
		your name, address, payment details, or what you actually bought — only
		aggregate commission reports.
	</p>

	<p>
		<strong>Pinterest.</strong> If you arrived here from Pinterest, Pinterest
		may have set cookies in your browser before you left their platform. That is
		governed by Pinterest's own privacy policy.
	</p>

	<h2>Your rights</h2>

	<p>Under GDPR you have the right to:</p>

	<ul>
		<li>ask what personal data is held about you</li>
		<li>ask for it to be corrected or deleted</li>
		<li>object to processing or ask that it be restricted</li>
		<li>lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority</li>
	</ul>

	<p>
		In Romania, the supervisory authority is ANSPDCP
		(<a href="https://www.dataprotection.ro" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"
			>dataprotection.ro</a
		>).
	</p>

	<h2>Changes</h2>

	<p>
		If this policy changes, the date at the top of the page is updated. Material
		changes will be noted on the page itself.
	</p>
</Layout>
